# Runtime-test weights for scripts/go-test-runtime-shards: seconds of go test
# -race per top-level agentcore/textureowner test, "<seconds> <package>:<TestName>".
# A shard runs its packages one after the other, so the deal balances the sum
# (heaviest first). An unlisted test weighs 1. The weights only balance: a
# stale or missing line never drops or repeats a test
